{
  "id": "section-how-the-game-works",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-how-the-game-works:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "How the Game Works\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[37,22,41]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-how-the-game-works:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "After creating your character,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[37,41,72]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-how-the-game-works:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "select a mission by rolling d6 on\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[37,72,106]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-how-the-game-works:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the Mission Table. This will give you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[37,106,144]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-how-the-game-works:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "a general goal to accomplish.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[37,144,174]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-how-the-game-works:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "When you complete that mission,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[37,174,206]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-how-the-game-works:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you will receive the listed rewards.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[37,206,243]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-how-the-game-works:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If your character survives, you will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[37,243,280]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-how-the-game-works:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "continue to play this character in\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[37,280,315]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-how-the-game-works:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "future missions. If s/he dies, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[37,315,350]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-how-the-game-works:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "will have to create a new one. The\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[37,350,385]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-how-the-game-works:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "final Campaign goal is to close 7\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[37,385,419]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-how-the-game-works:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "hell gates. Once that is done (this\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[37,419,455]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-how-the-game-works:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "will happen over the course of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[37,455,486]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-how-the-game-works:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "multiple missions), you win the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[37,486,518]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-how-the-game-works:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "game.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[37,518,524]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    37
  ]
}
